    "interpretation": "The Canada branch tests whether the estimated EU post-2016 decline is unique relative to a never-treated OECD procurement system. Because CanadaBuys reports procurement method rather than bidder counts over the full 2009--2023 window, this is an external proxy-control robustness check rather than a replacement for the TED-based main DiD."
  },
